OL,3,GNEWSAProject to replace pavements on
OL,4,Amain road to begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to improve pavements on a
OL,7,Fmain road in Leicester is set to enter
OL,8,Fits next phase.
OL,10,FLeicester City Council is replacing the
OL,11,Foutbound section of Melton Road's
OL,12,Fpavement, between Portsmouth Road and
OL,13,FHerbert Avenue, and on the inbound
OL,14,Fsection between Acorn Street and Moira
OL,15,FStreet.
OL,17,FIt will mean uneven and broken slabs
OL,18,Fwill be replaced with concrete blocks,
OL,19,Fwhich is designed to improve drainage
OL,20,Fand stop water pooling on pavements, as
OL,21,Fwell as placing porous, resin-bound
OL,22,Fgravel around trees.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
